  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CZOR, Centar za omladinski rad</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Aims at reducing alcohol-related harm and protecting youth in Serbia and the Western Balkans by addressing alcohol harm as a structural barrier to youth health, gender equality and democratic development. Through policy advocacy, community mobilisation and youth-led monitoring, CZOR targets minors and young people, prioritising care-experienced, not-in-education, Roma, and refugee/migrant youth. Activities include legal harmonisation and excise tax earmarking, Mystery Shopper monitoring, outreach youth work, public campaigns, youth centres, and alliance-building via SAPA/BAPA-networks.</narrative>
  </description>
